# The Vercel CLI does not read .gitignore: it uploads everything except its
# built-in defaults (node_modules, .next, .vercel, .env.local, ...) and the
# rules below. The tender PDFs and the search index are client documents and
# must never leave this machine through a deploy.
#
# No trailing slash on purpose: the CLI tests the bare folder name, so "/data/"
# would still list an empty "data" entry in the upload.
/data
